# Deliberately NOT ignored, despite being generated:
#
#   likec4/.likec4/*.likec4.snap
#     Connector geometry produced by tools/orthogonal-router. A checkout without these files
#     renders LikeC4's native diagonal splines instead of orthogonal routes, so they are part
#     of what makes a render reproducible. Keeping them visible also matters because AGENTS.md
#     requires all work to stay in the working tree for review; ignoring them would hide the
#     router's output from `git status`.
#
#   tools/orthogonal-router/package-lock.json
#     Pins the exact likec4 build that produced the approved render.
